MaeShare is a LocalSend-compatible client for the Nokia N900 / Maemo 5 (Fremantle).
UI, Maemo integration plugin and packaging: Apache License 2.0.

LocalSend protocol and the random-name dictionaries: LocalSend project and contributors
(Apache-2.0). No official LocalSend logo is included in this release.

Network core (probe): derived from MeeShare / ChengChihz-MeeGo-Share
(Copyright 2026 Chih, Apache-2.0), adapted and extended for Fremantle.

Mbed TLS 3.6.7: Mbed TLS contributors; Apache-2.0 option selected.
QJson: Flavio Castelli and other contributors; GNU Library General Public License
version 2 or later. Source copy obtained from glKarin/weibomm; original file notices
are retained.
Qt 4.7 and Qt Quick 1: runtime libraries supplied by the device; their licenses remain
unchanged.
libsharing / sharing-manager: Nokia device framework, dynamically loaded at runtime;
its license remains unchanged.

MaeShare is an independent compatible implementation, not affiliated with or endorsed
by the LocalSend project.
